export anchor VibrantClassicStyle:
    number: 287
    screen: CodeRepository
    name: Vibrant classic
    idea: A dense, square, all-monospace review workspace on near-black, with a file tree, a dominant syntax-coloured diff and a narrow facts pane butted together by hairlines, where hot pink, lime and orange do the talking.
    base: dark
    palette:
        coal: #1b1b18, the page background and the diff pane
        slate: #26261f, the top bar, the file tree and facts panes, the style sheet cards
        ridge: #34342c, the selected file row, chips and the disabled merge button
        rule: #4a4a40, hairlines between panes and rows
        chalk: #f8f8f2, text
        smoke: #b4b4a6, meta, line numbers and pane labels
        hotPink: #ff5c93, keywords, the current tab bar, the pull request number and pane labels markers
        lime: #a6e22e, the primary button, passed, approved, Open and added lines
        orange: #fd971f, requested changes, strings and attribute names
        cyan: #66d9ef, links, JSX tags and focus
        purple: #ae81ff, constants and counts
        red: #ff6b6b, failing and removed lines
        addTint: #25301a, added line rows
        delTint: #3a1f24, removed line rows
    type:
        One monospace stack for everything, ui-monospace, SF Mono, Cascadia Mono,
        DejaVu Sans Mono, Menlo, Consolas. Base 13px at 1.5, the title 20px at 700,
        pane labels 11px caps tracked 0.12em with a pink square marker, counts 12px
        at 700.
    layout:
        Full width, no outer margin. A 44px slate top bar holds the owner and
        repository, a Private tag, watch 12, star 48 and fork 3 as inline counters,
        and the six tabs as flat text tabs with a 2px pink top bar on Pull requests.
        Under it one dense summary strip shows the number 214 in pink, the title,
        Open, Sam Ortiz merging 6 commits into main from feature/push-prefs, the
        checks score and the two review verdicts, separated by hairlines. Then three
        panes butted together with 1px rules. A 260px file tree with folder rows and
        each file with plus and minus counts, the current file highlighted. A wide
        diff pane with a file tab bar, the hunk, syntax colours and the inline
        comment. A 300px facts pane with reviewers, all twelve checks in a compact
        list, labels, assignees, milestone, linked issue and the merge button. Below
        1100px the facts pane drops under the diff, below 760px all three stack.
    spacing: A 4px unit. 8px row padding, 12px pane padding, no gaps between panes.
    density: Dense. Everything visible at once, small type, tight rows.
    corners: Square everywhere, 2px on chips only.
    borders:
        1px rule hairlines between panes and rows. A 2px pink top bar on the current
        tab and a 2px cyan left edge on the comment.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.5px stroke at 1em, square caps. Check circle for passed and
        approved, crossed square for failing, triangle with a bang for requested
        changes, padlock for the blocked merge, always next to the word.
    focus: A 2px cyan outline offset 1px.
    tone: Terse and technical, such as checks 11/12, e2e-android failing and merge blocked.
